"— Implementation of several measures to prevent unexpected influence on battles."

— An attack can't be sent in 10 minutes before the arrival of another attack and in 10 minutes after it;
— Despite this, an attack can be sent to the city in the period of 3 minutes after any other attack, that does't have any more attacks arriving in 3 minutes before and can't be cancelled;
— A reinforcement can't be sent in the period of 5 minutes after any other attack arrives in the city;
—When sending troops that arrive during the forbidden period, the game interface will inform you, that the arrival time has been corrected or will offer another arrival time if one was set by a user;
— A military operation here is considered an attack / reinforcement.

All measures are going to be implemented withing the following 2 days.

