Change log:
— Special reports that contain some information about your account or cities, are available to create. Access to them can be provided;
— Budget payments for training troops can be set up;
— When sending troops on ships, optimization of the army speed and size is available;
— The Colosseum provides a 9% war bonus (10% before);
— War bonus for Luck Coins provides 9% per a level (10% before);
— War bonus from Great Generals has been slightly decreased.

Already in 2th, 3th, 4th, 5th and 6th worlds.

